{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Project: G-ASTRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax, explore, discover! Gather materials and upgrade yourself to traverse this new, vast land. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">G-ASTRO is a single-player exploration game where you uncover the mystery of this new world. Play as a hyperintelligent, intergalactic, space <strong>Snail</strong> and determine if the Planet suits Gastropod-kind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">G-ASTRO offers new, unique creatures to scan, observe, and interact with, a unique crafting system, and thrilling movement mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/snail_with_mystery_monument.png?t=1744754992\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have Fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/Pause.png?t=1744754992\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602060?t=1744754992","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602060?t=1744754992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/ebd3a5f8a0fc80990db947b601bddacbbe24e9e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744754992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/ebd3a5f8a0fc80990db947b601bddacbbe24e9e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744754992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","